  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JHCO - HUMANITARIAN AID TO GAZA FOOD PARCEL DISTRIBUTION</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Delivery of up to 3,000 Food parcels to Vulnerablepopulations and IDPs in Gaza at a cost of US40.3 per parcel. Expected Outcomes 1- Immediate Food Security: Increased access to essential food items for Families in Gaza. 2- Improved Health and Nutrition: Contribute in efforts to increase access to food for extremely vulnerable people in near-famine conditions. 3- Strengthened Community Resilience: Enhanced capacity of local organizations and community leaders to respond to ongoing humanitarian needs.</narrative>
  </description>
